arbeitnow:commercial-account-executive-3:
&lt;div class="ace-line"&gt;
&lt;div class="ace-line" data-node-type="line"&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;As an Commercial Account Executive on our Commercial team you'll be responsible for seeking out new opportunities within both new logos and our existing customer base. You will have experience prospecting, running discovery calls/demos, negotiating, and a track record of closing new business. You should also understand use cases and how to sell across multiple departments and industries. To be successful in this role you will understand how to go after new business and build relationships with potential customers. Intrigued? We want to speak to you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU'LL DO &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice="3 3 []"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage the entire sales cycle, which includes prospecting, conducting discovery calls and demos, negotiating deals, and closing new &amp;amp; existing business across all industries in the Small Medium Business segment (1-2000 employees).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct thorough research to understand your customers and prospects better. Gain insight into their unique business challenges and how Box can provide value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive the sales process by influencing key stakeholders both internally and externally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop a comprehensive territory plan that covers all aspects of your target market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schedule visits to meet customers face-to-face within your assigned territory if you feel appropriate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice="3 3 []"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German speaker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years of experience in a closing sales role, with a proven track record of success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;Strong hunter with demonstrated pipeline generation creativity (events, social selling, automation tools).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;Skilled in qualification and deal progression frameworks (MEDDIC familiarity helpful; outcome-focused mindset essential).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity and eagerness to learn about Box’s product, new technologies, the industry, and your customer's businesses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear examples of successfully closing deals using an established sales process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effectively utilizes a repeatable method for identifying untapped opportunities and expanding into new territories&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous experience in building relationships and selling to executives at all level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of 3 days per week. Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based on current business needs, there is no relocation assistance provided for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box Benefits package includes 30 days of vacation, medical, and dental coverage. We have a robust wellness program including 30 days of vacation (plus your birthday off!) and subsidized gym membership. Boxers can also participate in our Employee Stock Purchase plan and other additional perks and benefits. Germany's office is based in a WeWork (Neuturmstrasse 5, Munich, BY 80331,) as well as other European offices across London, Paris, Amsterdam, and Warsaw.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href="https://cloud.app.box.com/s/dalfrm4h1m5wkjiq6171hbko9uwroulg" target="_blank" data-attrib-id="link-d0f4f175-3786-4719-8525-e15da4281b97"&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTICE OF USE OF AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href="https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/" target="_blank" data-attrib-id="link-b6d5ae6d-3111-427e-8883-655af5f92bce"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:category-management-future-lea:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What’s it like to manage the commercial engine of Europe’s fastest-growing online supermarket? At Picnic, we don't just buy products - we redefine how food reaches millions of homes by building smarter assortments, negotiating hard with global brands, and launching our own Private Label lines. 🥑🥐🍎&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our &lt;strong&gt;Category Management - Future Leaders Graduate Program&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll take full end-to-end commercial ownership from day one. You’ll sit at the intersection of quantitative analysis, supplier negotiations, and product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will actually do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a rotation program or an advisory role. You won't just recommend what to sell - you will own the P&amp;amp;L of your category and execute every step yourself:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Strategy &amp;amp; Improvement Plans: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and execute clear commercial roadmaps for your category - analyzing performance gaps, setting growth targets, and continually balancing customer experience, gross margin, and long-term category health.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare and lead negotiations that secure the best terms. From initial outreach to signed contracts, you'll own the process end-to-end&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Assortment Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Dive deep into customer purchase data, elasticity models, and unit economics to prune underperforming SKUs and introduce winning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Label Development&lt;/strong&gt;:Collaborate on the creation of Picnic’s own products - from sustainable packaging and pricing to quality checks and market positioning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Margin &amp;amp; Price Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously monitor cost changes, inflation impacts, and competitor pricing to protect margins while keeping Picnic unbeatable on price.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with supply chain, design, and analytics teams to align commercial goals with operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We set a high bar. We look for top-tier candidates who combine sharp quantitative thinking with a natural commercial drive and zero hesitation to pick up the phone and negotiate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finishing (or recently finished) an&lt;strong&gt; Msc &lt;/strong&gt;in Business, Economics, Finance, Econometrics, Supply Chain, Food Retail, or a related field (0–1 year of full-time work experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience gained via internships, student organizations, or extracurricular activities is mandatory - in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving, high-intensity environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with &lt;strong&gt;complex data&lt;/strong&gt; to drive tangible business outcomes, whether that’s uncovering growth levers or building a winning negotiation strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy &lt;strong&gt;negotiating&lt;/strong&gt;. You hold your ground with experienced suppliers, build long-term value, and back up your positions with hard data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don't hand off contract administration, cost recalculations, or SKU setups to someone else - you &lt;strong&gt;execute every detail of your strategy yourself&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;constantly ask&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;"Why does this product cost X to produce?"&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;"Why are we not carrying category Y?"&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English (Dutch or German is a strong advantage for local supplier negotiations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="2"&gt;Not sure which track fits you best?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node="3,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Choose Category Management&lt;/strong&gt; if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="60"&gt;products, supplier negotiations, unit economics, and food trends.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node="3,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Choose Strategy &lt;/strong&gt;if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="43"&gt;app user behavior, digital storefront optimization, and campaign execution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node="3,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Choose Analytics &lt;/strong&gt;if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="44"&gt;solving complex business problems, data modeling, and technical implementation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:head-of-brand-global-campaigns:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Head of Brands &amp;amp; Global Campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Brand Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand: Myprotein / Myvitamins&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: 5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Fully Office Based)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to join the Brand team at a pivotal time for both Myprotein and Myvitamins. Reporting directly to the Brand Director, you'll play a key role in bringing our brand strategy to life through best-in-class, integrated global campaigns that drive brand awareness, customer engagement and commercial growth across our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Brand &amp;amp; Global Campaigns, you'll lead the planning and delivery of our annual global campaign calendar, owning the development of high-impact, insight-led campaigns across both brands. This is a campaign-heavy leadership role, responsible for ensuring our biggest global brand moments are delivered consistently across every customer touchpoint, while maintaining creative excellence and commercial focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll work cross-functionally with Creative, Social, Influencer, PR, CRM, Media, Product Marketing, Commercial and Regional Marketing teams to deliver integrated global campaigns that strengthen our brand positioning and support business objectives. Alongside campaign delivery, you'll lead and develop a high-performing Brand &amp;amp; Campaigns team, embedding best practice and continually raising the standard of brand execution across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You'll Be Responsible For:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the development and execution of integrated 360° global brand campaigns across Myprotein and Myvitamins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the annual global campaign calendar, ensuring key launches, innovation moments and seasonal activations are delivered on time and to the highest standard across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating brand strategy into compelling global campaign plans that build brand equity while supporting commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with the Brand Director to evolve and execute the long-term global brand vision across both brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Creative, Social, Influencer, PR, CRM, Paid Media, Product Marketing, Commercial and Regional Marketing teams to ensure campaigns are fully integrated across every channel and market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing creative excellence throughout campaign development, ensuring consistency of messaging, visual identity and execution across all customer touchpoints globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using customer insights, market trends and campaign performance to continually optimise future campaigns and identify opportunities for innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing campaign budgets, timelines and resource planning to ensure efficient delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships with senior stakeholders across the business, influencing decision-making and aligning teams behind shared global campaign objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading, coaching and developing a high-performing Brand &amp;amp; Campaigns team, fostering collaboration, accountability and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We're Looking For:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in brand and integrated global campaign marketing, ideally within a global consumer, retail, lifestyle or wellness business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing and delivering large-scale, multi-channel global campaigns that deliver measurable brand and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of brand strategy and how to translate it into engaging, customer-first global campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence at all levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commercially minded approach, balancing creativity with business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and project management skills, with experience managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence using consumer insights and campaign data to inform decisions and optimise future activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building globally recognised brands and creating campaigns that customers genuinely connect with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;What’s in it for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Career Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="18" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Access bespoke development programmes that have been designed and developed by our in-house L&amp;amp;D team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="18" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Continued development through our upskilling programme that is delivered in partnership with an industry-leading training provider.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
